 "description": "Full record for one listing id: request and response schemas, sample_query, observed 402 terms (network, payTo, scheme, x402 version), reputation detail, and paid_verification (our latest real USDC purchase, with its settlement tx where proven). Call it before paying, for the exact request shape and current reliability. Quote dates (every timestamp has an _iso twin); on-chain counts describe the seller's wallet, usually shared by several listings, not this endpoint. Paid verdict, pay / caution / avoid with reasons and verified alternatives: GET https://api.nohumans.directory/v1/listings/{id}/verdict ($0.005 USDC on Base via x402). Every purchase we made of it: GET https://api.nohumans.directory/v1/listings/{id}/purchases ($0.01 USDC on Base via x402). Free, read-only.",
